{"title":"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 32","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each angle of a rectangle is trisected. The intersections of the pairs of trisectors adjacent to the same side always form: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/d/71d19bbf0a206f19df54c38b3bd0b059e57dbf28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{a square} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{a rectangle} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{a parallelogram with unequal sides}\\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{a rhombus}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{a quadrilateral with no special properties}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"561\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/2/e722c01dedf00b9176b1b1e12980e21826a1ba81.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(1cm); pair A, B, C, D; A = (0,0); B = (0,3); C = (4.5,3); D = (4.5,0); draw(A--B--C--D--cycle);  pair Ab, Ba, Bc, Cb, Cd, Dc, Da, Ad; Ab = A + 0.5*(D-A)*dir(60); Ba = B + 0.5*(D-A)*dir(-60); Bc = B + 0.7*(D-A)*dir(-30); Cb = C + 0.7*(D-A)*dir(210); Cd = C + 0.5*(D-A)*dir(240); Dc = D + 0.5*(D-A)*dir(120); Da = D + 0.7*(D-A)*dir(150); Ad = A + 0.7*(D-A)*dir(30);  draw(A--Ab, red); draw(A--Ad, red); draw(B--Ba, red); draw(B--Bc, red); draw(C--Cb, red); draw(C--Cd, red); draw(D--Da, red); draw(D--Dc, red);  label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, SW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, NW); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, NE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, D, SE);  pair E_, F, G, H; E_ = intersectionpoint(A--Ab, B--Ba); F = intersectionpoint(B--Bc, C--Cb); G = intersectionpoint(C--Cd, D--Dc); H = intersectionpoint(D--Da, A--Ad);  label(&quot;$E$&quot;, E_, W); label(&quot;$F$&quot;, F, N); label(&quot;$G$&quot;, G, E); label(&quot;$H$&quot;, H, S);  draw(E_--F, blue); draw(F--G, blue); draw(G--H, blue); draw(H--E_, blue);  dot(E_, blue); dot(F, blue); dot(G, blue); dot(H, blue); [/asy]\" width=\"262\" height=\"185\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> be the vertices of the rectangle, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b1902d279ba37d60bdce4e0e987b7cd19d48974e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> be the intersections of the angle trisectors.  \n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a rectangle, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/a/b9a427387ff6212e24b2c3bf3ce692b2e62d50a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = CD$\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/d/e8dce804f51f7b44a20ee97159a9c003f0489001.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD = BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"14\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/7/0e7d33cd9e5c2a3dceeb0a0ff82d27225080d559.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle EAB = \\angle EBA = \\angle GCD = \\angle GDC = 30^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"350\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/b/a1b3b8188354494cb248bd9965a24d0b9f1ef814.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AEB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52eb4a7e22b96f7728d01d57f7eff9ef62974f0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle CGD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" /> are isosceles.  Also, by ASA, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/4/5e4db2362fced4c06c7ea93ae674907ae1215658.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AEB \\cong \\triangle CGD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"145\" height=\"18\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/027a2cf43f844e984621f12fc34c2a2913160438.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE = EB = CG = GD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"190\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/8209308f06d47e613ed2dee4358013adfbc85957.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle FBC = \\angle FCB = \\angle HAD = \\angle HDA = 30^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"354\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/b/f6bab865ddf3fe5b09b3f223ed56527efe747af1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BFC$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/a/4fa06ea13ae6e48d923338fc41b92d287a878553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AHD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" /> are also isosceles. By ASA, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/d/19d8b9a380527b23cc7f9fe6f62eb3201c8f3cb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BFC \\cong \\triangle AHD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"147\" height=\"18\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/d/e9dc93abd5b373b80e720f090942b7a35d92f5b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BF = FC = AH = HD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"194\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/2/b92e8fc23d33902bfd1a2b03039699410cc3e8dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle HAE = \\angle FBE = \\angle FCG = \\angle HDG = 30^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"353\" height=\"15\" />, by SAS, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/0/7d0b8bc96b6b919efc8fe63c077e5f237dff826c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle HAE \\cong \\triangle FBE \\cong \\triangle FCG = \\triangle HDG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"317\" height=\"18\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/7/4070dd7ffde67359e002dc30cc844331eebbcb2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$HE = FE = FG = HG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"194\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/3/9735b37ac43861ef9e105bff1711f117917b09ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EFGH$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/c/47ccb6e5e05aacf212a38d1c87526c35a66c06a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{a rhombus}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"124\" height=\"30\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Remark\">Remark</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Remark\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/d/7edf0e77ba01b60d3de33cb075294fceda88793b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{BC}{AB} = \\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"83\" height=\"39\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/5/f05459228a5a8690fab05bfb0f617a1144dda619.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F = H$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> and the rhombus formed is degenerate.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME\" title=\"1953 AHSME\">1953 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1953 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1953\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">Problem 31</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">Problem 33</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">36</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">37</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">38</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">39</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">40</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_41\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 41\">41</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 42\">42</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_43\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 43\">43</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 44\">44</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 45\">45</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 46\">46</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 47\">47</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_48\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 48\">48</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 49\">49</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_50\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 50\">50</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017063104\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 285/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3129/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 236/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6869/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    9.124      1 Template:AHSME_50p_box\n100.00%    9.124      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:18577:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017063104 and revision id 291027. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}